WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.354 --> 00:00:04.795
- All Flavor No Grease is a new version

00:00:04.795 --> 00:00:08.595
of bringing unity to the
community through food.

00:00:08.595 --> 00:00:11.162
(upbeat mood music)

00:00:11.162 --> 00:00:12.882
Nobody has died on this street,

00:00:12.882 --> 00:00:16.626
no gunfire within the
last, like, five years,

00:00:16.626 --> 00:00:17.840
for a fact.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.976
(upbeat mood music)

00:00:20.976 --> 00:00:23.016
There's a ceasefire and
a peace treaty going on

00:00:23.016 --> 00:00:26.824
from the consensus of
food on 108th street.

00:00:26.824 --> 00:00:30.128
(upbeat mood music)

00:00:30.128 --> 00:00:32.139
My name is Keith Garrett,
and I am the owner

00:00:32.139 --> 00:00:33.763
of All Flavor No Grease.

00:00:33.763 --> 00:00:35.443
- [Interviewer] And, will you
look at me the whole time?

00:00:35.443 --> 00:00:36.276
- Okay.

00:00:36.276 --> 00:00:37.299
- [Interviewer] So, will
you just give that to me

00:00:37.299 --> 00:00:38.132
one more time?

00:00:38.132 --> 00:00:41.179
(boisterous laughter)

00:00:41.179 --> 00:00:42.012
- Okay.

00:00:44.788 --> 00:00:47.174
Chicken sticks, stick trick!

00:00:47.174 --> 00:00:49.856
(upbeat mood music)

00:00:49.856 --> 00:00:51.769
All Flavor No Grease actually started

00:00:51.769 --> 00:00:53.665
out of my mother's kitchen.

00:00:53.665 --> 00:00:56.889
The way my mother made a
taco was lettuce, tomatoes,

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:59.305
cheese, sour cream, ketchup, hot sauce.

00:00:59.305 --> 00:01:03.137
So, that's the way I started,
and then, we transitioned

00:01:03.137 --> 00:01:07.253
into our food truck, which we are in now.

00:01:07.253 --> 00:01:08.983
The kind of food that I serve,

00:01:08.983 --> 00:01:13.310
I would have to put it under
Americanized Mexican food,

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:16.998
and only reason why I say that
is because I do serve tacos,

00:01:16.998 --> 00:01:19.486
burritos, quesadillas and enchiladas,

00:01:19.486 --> 00:01:22.494
but I don't make ‘em a traditional way.

00:01:22.494 --> 00:01:23.406
Like, nah.

00:01:23.406 --> 00:01:27.918
It's a whole different
feel and flavor, baby.

00:01:27.918 --> 00:01:28.830
♪ It's ready, eh ♪

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:30.046
♪ Like all ready, eh, ♪

00:01:30.046 --> 00:01:32.292
♪ Like all ready, eh, eh, eh, eh, eh ♪

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:33.288
Oh, there we go.

00:01:33.288 --> 00:01:35.847
(upbeat mood music)

00:01:35.847 --> 00:01:37.423
When you really think about it,

00:01:37.423 --> 00:01:40.535
we're bringing together
all flavors of people,

00:01:40.535 --> 00:01:42.895
from gang members to politicians,

00:01:42.895 --> 00:01:44.807
and there's no confrontation,

00:01:44.807 --> 00:01:46.295
no blood being spilled.

00:01:46.295 --> 00:01:48.318
There's no grease being spilled anywhere,

00:01:48.318 --> 00:01:51.568
but yet, we still got all flavors here.

00:01:52.583 --> 00:01:54.368
I would love to go to the poverty areas,

00:01:54.368 --> 00:01:57.911
and to just to let them
know that you can make it.

00:01:57.911 --> 00:02:00.919
There is a such thing as hope,

00:02:00.919 --> 00:02:02.183
but you have to work.

00:02:02.183 --> 00:02:05.600
You gotta get yo ass up and do something.

00:02:06.792 --> 00:02:10.375
To see 500 plus people
pull up to my truck,

00:02:11.777 --> 00:02:14.758
it really makes me think about one person,

00:02:14.758 --> 00:02:17.077
and his name is Pharrell.

00:02:17.077 --> 00:02:20.733
♪ 'Cause I'm so happy ♪

00:02:20.733 --> 00:02:23.650
(joyous laughter)

